<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman and four other members of the Council shall form a quorum at any meeting of the Council."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/1/eng@/~part_III__cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/1/eng@> .
